-# Devise sign-in view. Renders the same shell as the ambient `/`
-# landing (`home#landing`) so failed-login re-renders and expired-
-# session redirects don't jump the user to a different-looking page.
-# Previously used `_kronk_auth_form` (a plain title + lede layout),
-# which meant `/` and `/auth/sign_in` looked like two different
-# apps — Tal flagged that on 2026-08-06.
-#
-# Prefill: pass `params.dig(:user, :email)` so a failed login keeps
-# the typed email in the field. Password is deliberately not
-# prefilled.

- content_for :page_title do
  = t('auth.login')

= render 'home/landing_body', prefill_email: params.dig(:user, :email)
